{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Memory 系统的完整架构设计\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请设计一个完整的 Agent Memory 系统，涵盖写入、存储、检索、更新、遗忘全链路，说明每个模块的职责和关键技术选型。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>系统架构总览</strong>：</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      Agent Memory System                       │\n├──────────┬──────────┬───────────┬──────────┬─────────────────┤\n│  写入     │  存储     │  检索      │  更新     │     遗忘        │\n│ (Write)  │ (Store)  │ (Retrieve) │ (Update) │   (Forget)      │\n├──────────┼──────────┼───────────┼──────────┼─────────────────┤\n│Embedding │Vector DB │Embedding  │语义聚类   │多因子评分        │\n│  编码    │KV Store  │相似度搜索  │增量摘要   │LRU/LFU          │\n│元数据标注│图数据库  │Cross-Enc  │冲突检测   │分层淘汰         │\n│触发器    │关系数据库│时间加权   │版本管理   │定期清理         │\n└──────────┴──────────┴───────────┴──────────┴─────────────────┘\n                         ↕\n                    Context Assembly\n                    （上下文组装）\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>全链路实现</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">CompleteMemorySystem</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"完整的记忆系统\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> config<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedder <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedder\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 存储层</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store   <span class=\"token comment\"># Milvus/Pinecone</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>kv_store <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>kv_store           <span class=\"token comment\"># Redis</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph_db <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph_db           <span class=\"token comment\"># Neo4j</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rel_db <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rel_db               <span class=\"token comment\"># PostgreSQL</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 子模块</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>writer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> MemoryWriter<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedder<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retriever <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> MemoryRetriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph_db<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>updater <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> MemoryUpdater<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>forgetter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> MemoryForgetter<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># ========== 写入链路 ==========</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">write</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> content<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memory_type<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> metadata<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        记忆写入流程:\n        1. 生成 Embedding\n        2. 提取元数据（时间、重要性、实体等）\n        3. 写入对应存储层\n        4. 触发更新（如去重、摘要）\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. Embedding</span>\n        embedding <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embed<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 提取元数据</span>\n        entry <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            content<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            embedding<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            timestamp<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            importance<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>writer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>score_importance<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            memory_type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>memory_type<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            metadata<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>metadata <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 写入向量库</span>\n        memory_id <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            embedding<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            content<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            metadata<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>to_metadata<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> memory_id\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 提取实体关系写入知识图谱</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> memory_type <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"fact\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"dialogue\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            triples <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>writer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>extract_triples<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> s<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> r<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> o <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> triples<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph_db<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_fact<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>s<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> r<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> o<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memory_id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>memory_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 5. 写入 KV 缓存（热数据）</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>kv_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"mem:</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>memory_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>serialize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ttl<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3600</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> memory_id\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># ========== 检索链路 ==========</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">retrieve</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> top_k<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                 filters<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        记忆检索流程:\n        1. 查询 Embedding\n        2. 粗排（ANN 搜索召回 Top-200）\n        3. 精排（Cross-Encoder Rerank）\n        4. 时间加权\n        5. 返回 Top-K\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 查询 Embedding</span>\n        query_embedding <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embed<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 粗排召回</span>\n        candidates <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            query_embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n            top_k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">200</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 召回更多做 Rerank</span>\n            filters<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>filters\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 精排（Cross-Encoder）</span>\n        reranked <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rerank<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> candidates<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> top_k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">50</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 时间加权（新记忆提升排名）</span>\n        time_weighted <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>apply_time_decay<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>reranked<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 5. 返回 Top-K</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> time_weighted<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>top_k<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># ========== 更新链路 ==========</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">update</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memory_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> new_content<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n               metadata_updates<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        记忆更新流程:\n        1. 获取原记忆\n        2. 检测冲突\n        3. 版本管理（旧版本标记过期）\n        4. 写入新版本\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        old_entry <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>memory_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> new_content<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 检测冲突</span>\n            conflicts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>updater<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>detect_conflicts<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>new_content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> old_entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> conflicts<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>updater<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>archive_old_versions<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>conflicts<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 生成新 Embedding</span>\n            new_embedding <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embed<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>new_content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 更新向量</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>update<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                memory_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                embedding<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>new_embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                content<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>new_content\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> metadata_updates<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>update_metadata<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>memory_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> metadata_updates<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># ========== 遗忘链路 ==========</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">forget</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> threshold_days<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">30</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        记忆遗忘流程:\n        1. 扫描所有记忆计算衰减分数\n        2. 低分记忆归档\n        3. 过期记忆清理\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        all_memories <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>scan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> mem <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> all_memories<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>forgetter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>compute_decay_score<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 归档</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>forgetter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>archive<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>delete<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 降低检索优先级</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_store<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>deprioritize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># ========== 上下文组装 ==========</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">assemble_context</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">4000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        为 LLM 调用组装上下文:\n        1. 检索相关记忆\n        2. 按重要性排序\n        3. 在 token 预算内组装\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        relevant <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retrieve<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> top_k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">20</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        context_parts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        current_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> mem <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">sorted</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>relevant<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> m<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> m<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>importance<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reverse<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            mem_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">//</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 粗略估算</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> current_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> mem_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">break</span>\n            context_parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            current_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> mem_tokens\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\\n---\\n\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context_parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>关键技术选型建议</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>备选方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Embedding</td>\n<td>BGE-M3（中文）、OpenAI ada-003（英文）</td>\n<td>E5、M3E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量数据库</td>\n<td>Milvus（大规模）/ Pinecone（托管）</td>\n<td>Weaviate、Qdrant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KV 缓存</td>\n<td>Redis</td>\n<td>Memcached</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识图谱</td>\n<td>Neo4j</td>\n<td>Nebula Graph</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系数据库</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>MySQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reranker</td>\n<td>BGE-Reranker</td>\n<td>Cross-Encoder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ANN 算法</td>\n<td>HNSW（在线）/ IVF+PQ（离线）</td>\n<td>Flat（小数据）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：写入链路中的延迟怎么优化？答：Embedding 和元数据提取可以异步化，主链路只写缓存，后台同步到向量库。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：检索链路中 Reranker 的必要性？答：ANN 召回的粗排精度有限，Reranker 可以提升 Top-K 的相关性 15-30%。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：记忆系统的监控指标？答：写入延迟、检索延迟、召回率、命中率、存储增长率、冲突率等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：用一个数据库解决所有问题。实际上不同存储有不同擅长的场景。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：忽视写入链路的性能。写入如果太慢会影响用户体验。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：检索只关注相关性。还需要考虑时效性、多样性、可信度等维度。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>","headings":[]}